{"id":"obyazatel_no","lemma":"обязательно","pos":"adv","rank":440,"glosses":["necessarily, without fail"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ee/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%8F%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%8F%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Нам обязательно было это делать?","en":"Was it necessary for us to do that?","words":[{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Думаешь, это обязательно надо сделать?","en":"Do you think it's necessary to do that?","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"must, necessary"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Нам обязательно нужно сделать это сегодня?","en":"Is it necessary for us to do that today?","words":[{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,{"g":"it is necessary"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"today"}]},{"text":"Я обязательно сделаю это завтра.","en":"I'll do that tomorrow for sure.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1267627","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"tomorrow"}]},{"text":"Он обязательно тебе поможет.","en":"He's sure to help you.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"to help","l":"помочь"}]}]}